==========================================================================================
THREAD 1: THE WITNESS ROUTE for LRC(n=2q),  q in {3,5,7}   (kpswf11 v2, corrected)
==========================================================================================

##########################################################################################
#  q=3  n=6=2*3   gap thr 1/q=1/3   G_P thr 1/n=1/6   speeds=5   LRC(6) PROVED
##########################################################################################

--- (1) admissible floor m_P^(6) (binding |P|=n-4=k=3 cluster) ---
    |P|= 3 (cluster k=2): min meas(G_P) = 1/5 = 0.2000000  at P=(1, 4, 5)
    |P|= 2 (cluster k=3): min meas(G_P) = 2/5 = 0.4000000  at P=(1, 5)  completable(k=3)=True

  >>> m_P^(6) = 2/5 = 0.40000000   at |P|=2, P=(1, 5)
      denominator 5 = 5

--- (2) PIGEONHOLE: k<q=3 => maxgap>=1/k>1/q => GOOD=[0,1) => G2=meas(G_P) ---
    k=2: maxgap>=1/2>1/3 ALWAYS => GOOD=[0,1)  (mu=1 confirmed: True)
    k=3: k=q: GOOD=[0,1) a.e. (mu=1 confirmed: True; equality x=a/q meas 0)

--- (3)+(4) WITNESS floor G2 over floor cases k=q..2q-1 ---
      k  |P|           min G2       =dec         m_P   G2/m_P  >=m_P?  argmin (E ; P)
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
      3    2              2/5   0.400000    0.400000    1.000    True  E=[0, 1, 2] ; P=[1, 5]
      4    1              4/9   0.444444    0.400000    1.111    True  E=[0, 1, 2, 3] ; P=[1]
      5    0              4/9   0.444444    0.400000    1.111    True  E=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4] ; P=[]

    => min G2 over k=q..2q-1: 2/5 = 0.400000;  m_P = 0.400000;  ALL G2>=m_P: True
       DENSE-k (k>=q+1) slack G2/m_P in [1.11, 1.11]

##########################################################################################
#  q=5  n=10=2*5   gap thr 1/q=1/5   G_P thr 1/n=1/10   speeds=9   LRC(10) PROVED
##########################################################################################

--- (1) admissible floor m_P^(10) (binding |P|=n-4=k=3 cluster) ---
    |P|= 7 (cluster k=2): min meas(G_P) = 151/2100 = 0.0719048  at P=(1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 8, 9)
    |P|= 6 (cluster k=3): min meas(G_P) = 781/6300 = 0.1239683  at P=(1, 3, 4, 5, 7, 9)  completable(k=3)=True

  >>> m_P^(10) = 781/6300 = 0.12396825   at |P|=6, P=(1, 3, 4, 5, 7, 9)
      denominator 6300 = 2^2 * 3^2 * 5^2 * 7

--- (2) PIGEONHOLE: k<q=5 => maxgap>=1/k>1/q => GOOD=[0,1) => G2=meas(G_P) ---
    k=2: maxgap>=1/2>1/5 ALWAYS => GOOD=[0,1)  (mu=1 confirmed: True)
    k=3: maxgap>=1/3>1/5 ALWAYS => GOOD=[0,1)  (mu=1 confirmed: True)
    k=4: maxgap>=1/4>1/5 ALWAYS => GOOD=[0,1)  (mu=1 confirmed: True)
    k=5: k=q: GOOD=[0,1) a.e. (mu=1 confirmed: True; equality x=a/q meas 0)

--- (3)+(4) WITNESS floor G2 over floor cases k=q..2q-1 ---
