    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
      5    4           93/280   0.332143    0.123968    2.679    True  E=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4] ; P=[1, 7, 8, 9]
      6    3            29/75   0.386667    0.123968    3.119    True  E=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5] ; P=[1, 8, 9]
      7    2           53/150   0.353333    0.123968    2.850    True  E=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6] ; P=[1, 8]
      8    1          211/525   0.401905    0.123968    3.242    True  E=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7] ; P=[1]
      9    0          241/525   0.459048    0.123968    3.703    True  E=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8] ; P=[]

    => min G2 over k=q..2q-1: 93/280 = 0.332143;  m_P = 0.123968;  ALL G2>=m_P: True
       DENSE-k (k>=q+1) slack G2/m_P in [2.85, 3.70]

